# Criminal Network Intelligence Visualizer

A single-file, production-grade React dashboard engineered with **TailwindCSS** and **`react-cytoscapejs`** to visualize syndicate structures, illicit communication links, and transaction flows in a law-enforcement dark-mode UI.

---

### Key Capabilities

```
┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  TOP BAR: Status Indicator | Threat Level | Graph Controls (Fit, Refresh, Reset)       │
├───────────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  SIDEBAR: Anomalies & Alerts  │  CENTRAL CANVAS: Cytoscape Graph Canvas               │
│  - Severity Badges (Crit/Hi) │  - Person: Red Circles                                  │
│  - Anomaly descriptions       │  - Phone: Blue Squares                                 │
│  - Click to highlight target  │  - Account: Green Triangles                            │
│                               │  - Directed Edges (Arrows)                             │
│                               │  - Force-directed COSE Layout                          │
│                               ├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                               │  OVERLAY: Node Properties Inspector                    │
│                               │  - Entity ID, Label, Type, Risk Score, Neighbors       │
└───────────────────────────────┴────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

---

### Prerequisites & Dependencies

To run this in a Vite + React project:

```bash
npm install cytoscape react-cytoscapejs
```

Ensure Tailwind CSS is enabled in your `tailwind.config.js`:

```javascript
/** @type {import('tailwindcss').Config} */
export default {
  content: ["./index.html", "./src/**/*.{js,ts,jsx,tsx}"],
  darkMode: 'class',
  theme: {
    extend: {},
  },
  plugins: [],
}
```

---

### Complete Single-File Component: `CriminalNetworkDashboard.jsx`

```jsx
import React, { useState, useEffect, useRef, useMemo } from 'react';
import CytoscapeComponent from 'react-cytoscapejs';

// =====================================================================
// Realistic Fallback Data (Used when Backend APIs are Offline)
// =====================================================================

const FALLBACK_GRAPH_ELEMENTS = [
  // --- PERSON NODES (Red Circles) ---
  { data: { id: 'p1', label: "Viktor 'The Ghost' Vance", type: 'person', role: 'Syndicate Leader', risk: 'CRITICAL', status: 'Active Target' } },
